p;amp;stripmeta=0&amp;amp;type=jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://imglf6.lf127.net/img/8826b752d05ba8c2/YjlIRmJ1djB4UklqK0lOTkM5RG5CV0ViSFV4QVF0bE11L3NuSEc3TTBrMD0.jpg?imageView&amp;amp;thumbnail=1680x0&amp;amp;quality=96&amp;amp;stripmeta=0&amp;amp;type=jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://imglf3.lf127.net/img/e0a049bade6b13cc/YjlIRmJ1djB4UklqK0lOTkM5RG5CV1ZYdStUU1ZadGRZd0dybkhPbWxKMD0.jpg?imageView&amp;amp;thumbnail=1680x0&amp;amp;quality=96&amp;amp;stripmeta=0&amp;amp;type=jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;p_ubom8wsp2do&quot;&gt;原生之初·伽古拉：第五律&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p id=&quot;p_u45m8wsp2dp&quot;&gt;摄影：九幽&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p id=&quot;p_uaim8wsp2dq&quot;&gt;后期：子玉&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p id=&quot;p_uram8wsp2dr&quot;&gt;后勤：鸩，暮穆&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p id=&quot;p_udxm8wsp2dt&quot;&gt;参考欧布年代记中的描述，给摄影老师描述了布景想法，景由污秽和尸骨堆积而成，伽古拉在经历了相当惨烈的混战后存活，同时心境也产生了变化。花了一个皮套钱做的服装道具，第一次写了个ppt跟摄影老师讨论怎么布景拍什么风格，打光参考了伽古拉写真集，得到了相当满意的片子～希望大家喜欢～&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://saisasuke.lofter.com/post/1e28f330_2be36cf06</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://saisasuke.lofter.com/post/1e28f330_2be36cf06</guid><pubDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 08:19:04 GMT</pubDate><author>第五律儿</author><category>凯伽</category><category>欧布奥特曼</category><category>cosplay</category><category>伽古拉</category><category>cos</category><category>奥特曼</category></item><item><title>请代我去往明天</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://imglf5.lf127.net/img/180c2f39ae3d9b34/U1V6QXNueDhsNFVxZUlPRlNaNjlZQjM5YTVXeDU2eHlTbHlrSXdHNXdXVT0.png?imageView&amp;amp;thumbnail=1680x0&amp;amp;quality=96&amp;amp;stripmeta=0%7Cwatermark&amp;amp;type=2&amp;amp;text=QCDkvZrlkI3mvZggIExPRlRFUiBJRDogYW5vbnltb3VzLXBkMTAyMg==&amp;amp;font=bXN5aA==&amp;amp;gravity=southwest&amp;amp;dissolve=100&amp;amp;fontsize=680&amp;amp;dx=32&amp;amp;dy=36&amp;amp;stripmeta=0&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://imglf5.lf127.net/img/bf6c5d20d0d6cef8/U1V6QXNueDhsNFVxZUlPRlNaNjlZRmFVcXhBbDV4ME5VS1lLR3NadDJHTT0.png?imageView&amp;amp;thumbnail=1680x0&amp;amp;quality=96&amp;amp;stripmeta=0%7Cwatermark&amp;amp;type=2&amp;amp;text=QCDkvZrlkI3mvZggIExPRlRFUiBJRDogYW5vbnltb3VzLXBkMTAyMg==&amp;amp;font=bXN5aA==&amp;amp;gravity=southwest&amp;amp;dissolve=100&amp;amp;fontsize=680&amp;amp;dx=32&amp;amp;dy=36&amp;amp;stripmeta=0&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://imglf4.lf127.net/img/66dfd10c7f895e54/U1V6QXNueDhsNFVxZUlPRlNaNjlZQ3ZkSTR6L0k4Ym1uTzdNUDUybE5paz0.png?imageView&amp;amp;thumbnail=1680x0&amp;amp;quality=96&amp;amp;stripmeta=0%7Cwatermark&amp;amp;type=2&amp;amp;text=QCDkvZrlkI3mvZggIExPRlRFUiBJRDogYW5vbnltb3VzLXBkMTAyMg==&amp;amp;font=bXN5aA==&amp;amp;gravity=southwest&amp;amp;dissolve=100&amp;amp;fontsize=680&amp;amp;dx=32&amp;amp;dy=36